  "restoration_notes": [
    "Extract the matching wrapper ZIP, then extract every listed dependency archive with strip_components=1 into its exact buildscripts/deps directory.",
    "Restore every recursive git submodule/fallback using the extra manifest into its recorded path; ordinary GitHub parent archives omit gitlink content.",
    "Do not run unmodified download-deps.sh to choose dependency revisions: it clones moving branches for five components and therefore does not reproduce this release.",
    "Do not set IN_CI=1 for matching this runtime: v_ci_ffmpeg=n9.0 is not the release's FFmpeg commit.",
    "Use the original build scripts with NDK r30, recorded configuration and source folders present; apply only explicit offline-restoration edits documented in the package.",
    "For each app ABI, run buildscripts/buildall.sh --arch armv7l|arm64|x86_64 mpv in the wrapper checkout, then the wrapper JNI Android.mk/NDK build. App code is separately built using shyniflex's public Gradle/build scripts.",
